@ Index:   Problem 2, payment difference present value
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ 100000 over 360 months: payment at 15%, payment at 12%, then PV of
@ the payment difference over 36 months at 15%.
LBL ‘P2’
  360
  STO ‘NPPER’
  15
  STO ‘I%/a’
  100000
  STO ‘PV’
  0
  STO ‘FV’
  12
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  ENDP
  0
  STO ‘PMT’
  PMT
  12
  STO ‘I%/a’
  DROP𝑥
  PMT
  -
  STO ‘PMT’
  36
  STO ‘NPPER’
  15
  STO ‘I%/a’
  PV
  END
